    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attention builders and DIY enthusiasts!!\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to offer for sale this centrally located property on Emmett Place just off St. Joseph Street and within a couple of blocks of Limerick city centre and all its amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property whilst requiring full refurbishment offers the discerning purchaser an opportunity to create and put their own stamp to this property.\r\nCurrent accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, living room, sitting room, kitchen, shower room and two double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside there is an enclosed walled rear courtyard and to the front there is street parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nAluminium entrance door with stained and leaded insets\r\n\r\nLiving Room - \r\nCentre piece and coving. Fireplace. TV point.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - \r\nTiled fireplace. Centre piece. Picture rail.\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nSingle drainer stainless steel sink unit. Floor level presses. Tiled floor. White aluminium door to rear.\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nShower with Triton electric shower. W. C. Wash hand basin. Tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - \r\n\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nFully enclosed walled rear courtyard laid with patio flags.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double fronted terraced property\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\nTwo reception rooms\r\nCul de sac\r\nExcellent city centre location\r\nProperty in need of entire refurbishment\r\nCourtyard to the rear"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
